data: {"id": "882aeb2261d745df-final", "run_id": "882aeb2261d745df", "seq": 2037, "ts_ms": 1788468560193, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | 容器 `app` 退出码 `137`，最后一次终止原因 `Error` (fact-448a8b1f0315, fact-7c1b58af9eb6) | 直接证据：OS OOM Killer 终止进程的标准信号码 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Liveness Probe 失败: `HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 500` (fact-b298fb8a7f97, 17次) | 触发重启机制：应用内存耗尽导致无法响应健康检查 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | 连续 `BackOff restarting failed container` (fact-899e1145253a, 100次) | 确认状态：Pod 因不断重启陷入 CrashLoopBackOff |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 为 `CrashLoopBackOff`，重启总数 `15` (fact-d7c0f20bcd6a, fact-2404f9364047) | 交叉验证：K8s 状态与监控数据一致，重启行为持续 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | 容器 `app` 硬限制 `memory: 96Mi` (fact-6cfcaabdfd70) | 核心归因：提供导致 OOM 的资源上限依据 |\n| 6 | Tracing | Tempo/Deepflow | `GET /work` 请求返回 `200`，模式标记为 `liveness_fail`，耗时 17ms~49ms (fact-6f5e95a61c3b, 等) | 辅助限定：应用在 OOM 前能短暂处理请求，表明是瞬时资源耗尽或泄漏 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n1. 退出码 `137`（事实 #1）与 `96Mi` 的内存限制（事实 #5）在逻辑上强相关，直接指向 OOM Kill 机制。\n2. 健康检查失败（事实 #2）和 BackOff 事件（事实 #3）是内存耗尽后的直接系统反应，证实了应用因资源问题不可用。\n3. 追踪数据（事实 #6）显示在触发故障前服务能短暂响应，结合低内存配置，进一步佐证了资源上限过小导致的崩溃。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器内存限制 (96Mi) 过小 → 内存超限触发 OOM Killer 强制终止 (Exit Code 137) → Kubelet 检测到 Liveness Probe 失败 (HTTP 500) 并执行重启 → Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：容器 `app` 的内存硬限制（`96Mi`）低于业务运行所需内存。当应用尝试分配超过 `96Mi` 的内存时，Linux OOM Killer 强制终止进程（证据 #1, #5）。这导致健康检查中断（证据 #2）和后续的频繁重启（证据 #3, #4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 29.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 78.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc: 78.4s (Evidence 69.2s, RCA 9.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc**: pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 118.453, "metrics": {"run_id": "882aeb2261d745df", "mttr": {"value": "2.0m", "seconds": 118.45290470123291, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 118452.90470123291, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 81488.70706558228, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 97164.90244865417, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 36553.40385437012}, "nodes": {"